  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CUSTOM_NETHER_PORTALS/MP_CUSTOM_NETHER_PORTALS_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2380\" height=\"874\"></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">受夠了千篇一律的地獄傳送門了嗎？</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">此模組允許您以任何形狀、大小和方向建造通往地獄的傳送門：地板、牆壁、天花板或懸浮皆可。此模組允許您建造任何形狀、大小和方向的通往地獄的傳送門：地板、牆壁、天花板或懸浮皆可。</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CUSTOM_NETHER_PORTALS/MP_CUSTOM_NETHER_PORTALS_Description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">透過自訂地獄傳送門打破常規限制：建立任意尺寸與形狀的地獄傳送門。完全自由地打造史詩級的地獄入口。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">此模組完全相容於 Fabric、Forge 與 Neoforge，適用於 Minecraft 1.20.1 與 1.21.1。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">此外，它能與其他維度模組完美協作。不會引發錯誤、衝突或干擾，確保您在自訂世界或模組包中擁有流暢無縫的遊玩體驗。</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1302224/description_7cd58fdf-ef60-4e09-97cd-40a197e13ed1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"126\"></strong></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>立即擁有屬於您的 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, s